   "text": "Three thirty-three AM. Your phone buzzes."
  },
  {
   "t": 3.0,
   "who": "narr",
   "text": "A text. From your own number."
  },
  {
   "t": 5.6,
   "who": "narr",
   "text": "It says: don't turn around."
  },
  {
   "t": 8.4,
   "who": "narr",
   "text": "Then the floor creaks. Behind you."
  },
  {
   "t": 11.3,
   "who": "narr",
   "text": "The screen goes black..."
  },
  {
   "t": 12.8,
   "who": "narr",
   "text": "And in the reflection, you see it."
  },
  {
   "t": 14.8,
   "who": "narr",
